# QA M5 flow (D-047, D-072, D-081; re-cut for D-087), re-cut in M6 (M6
# flow task: Strobl is playable): Hackl Resi through St. Wolfgang and the
# Wolfgangsee, then the route map Wolfgangsee -> Strobl in Wait and the
# Strobl intro with the run carried over. Title flow with the run started
# at St. Wolfgang: the first 6470 frames of
# qa_m4_flow_st_wolfgang_hackl_to_wolfgangsee (the qa_st_wolfgang_relaxed
# inputs, Hackl from 4305, Maibaum 5491, the map in Wait, the Wolfgangsee
# intro at 6320 drawing `player_hackl`), then from 6470 a route through
# the Wolfgangsee found by a scratch beam search that keeps the Hackl
# (never hurt): Wolfgangsee clear at 10885 as Hackl, the tally, the route
# map Wolfgangsee -> Strobl (11401; Wait from 11477, `player_hackl` on the
# map and St. Wolfgang's raised label, D-072), no START: the map's
# 300-frame wait starts the Strobl intro at 11777 (drawing
# `player_hackl`), play starts at 11927 as Hackl with score, lives and
# Oblaten kept (35900, 3, 68). Shots: the map in Wait as Hackl (11535,
# prompt on) and the Strobl intro (11797). The Normal-form map in Wait is
# wolfgangsee_tour's `route_map` shot.
# Was `qa_m5_flow_hackl_wolfgangsee_teaser_title` (teaser, title, run
# reset): the teaser moved to Bad Ischl -> Café Zauner (bad_ischl_tour,
# flow_m6_bad_ischl_teaser_title).
# This is also the M6 flow "Wolfgangsee clear -> map (Wait) -> Strobl
# intro with carry-over, Hackl included".
